{#-
 # A scratch card: a prize, a draw or a result decided by the server, under a cover the `scratch-card` controller paints
 # on a canvas and that is scratched away with a mouse, a finger or a pen; the button below it reveals it at once, by a
 # click or the keyboard. Once revealed, the prize is said in a polite live region and the `Celebration` of the page
 # may play. Without the controller, the prize shows from the start. No style is written here: the canvas waits in a
 # template, and the controller sets it over the prize through the CSSOM.
 #}
{%- props
    ## string The words of the button that reveals the prize at once.
    label = 'Reveal',
    ## string What is said once the prize is revealed; the text of the prize when empty.
    message = '',
    ## int The share of the cover, in percent, that reveals the whole prize once scratched away, kept between 10 and 90.
    threshold = 50,
    ## ''|'confetti'|'fireworks'|'lasers'|'balloons'|'shooting-stars'|'streamers'|'coins'|'bubbles'|'aurora'|'spotlight'|'trophy' The effect the `Celebration` of the page plays once the prize is revealed; none when empty.
    effect = ''
-%}
<div data-scratch-card-message-value="{{ message }}" data-scratch-card-threshold-value="{{ threshold }}" data-scratch-card-effect-value="{{ effect }}" data-scratch-card-color-value="--muted-foreground" data-slot="scratch-card"{{ attributes.defaults({class: 'flex flex-col items-start gap-2', 'data-controller': 'scratch-card'}) }}>
<div class="relative min-w-64 overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-dashed border-border p-6 [&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0" data-scratch-card-target="prize">
{##- The prize, decided by the server. -#}
{%- block content %}{% endblock -%}
</div><template data-scratch-card-target="stage"><canvas class="absolute inset-0 size-full cursor-crosshair touch-none" aria-hidden="true" data-action="pointerdown->scratch-card#press pointermove->scratch-card#scratch pointerup->scratch-card#release pointercancel->scratch-card#release"></canvas></template><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-4 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-primary-foreground outline-none hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50" data-scratch-card-target="button" data-action="scratch-card#reveal" hidden>{{ label }}</button><p class="m-0 empty:hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-scratch-card-target="message"></p></div>
